#. Description of the 'Preferred Email for Applications' (Data) field in
#. DocType 'Person'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/person/person.json:295
msgid ""
"Where partners should reach you about job applications. Leave blank to use "
"your primary email."
msgstr ""
